Aster Code applies a documented patch to @openai/codex-security 0.1.11. The
patch adds the fixed DeepSeek Responses provider, instance-scoped environment
isolation, and a read-only token-usage callback. It does not remove sealed
artifact validation, sandbox policy, output isolation, or scan contracts. The
complete patch is distributed in patches/@openai__codex-security@0.1.11.patch.

